{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Hanging out With Friends", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Making Plans", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 1, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 1, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "  Exchange advice and suggestions in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Questions with Sentences / Asking for Clarification", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You ask for clarification when you want more details of what the other person is talking about. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "We often ask for clarification when we are not clear on what the other person is referring to. We ask the other person to be more specific by giving more information. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can use questions with sentences to ask for clarification. You ask a question including a sentence within the question, like <span class=\"italic\">Don't you think it sounds a bit too intense?</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Questions with sentences are called <span class=\"strong\">embedded questions</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can use <span class=\"strong\">embedded questions</span> like <span class=\"italic\">Can you tell me ... ?</span> or <span class=\"italic\">Do you know if/which/what ... ?</span> to ask for clarification. Look at the chart below for an explanation on how to make embedded questions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Main Question\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Embedded Question\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Do you know ... \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" what/where/when/who/ \u2026 ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Do you remember ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" what/where/when/who/ \u2026 ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Can you tell me ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" what/where/when/who/ \u2026 ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Could you tell me ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" what/where/when/who/ \u2026 ?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Do you know which fitness club you'll go to? (question with sentence)", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Don't you think it sounds a bit too intense? (asking for clarification)", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Talking About Future Actions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You can use two different tenses to talk about the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<ul><li>When you talk about things that are not decided or when you make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future, you use the modal <span class=\"italic\">will</span>.</li><li>When you ask about intentions, you use <span class=\"italic\">going to</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Structure\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">I think I'll try everything.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Going to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I'm going to join a fitness club.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "resolution", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a decision you make and that you want to keep", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I don't like to make New Year's resolutions.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le01ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about social activities or to make plans.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to stick to", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to continue doing something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I can never stick to my resolutions for more than two weeks.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le01ob01aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "fitness ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the condition of being physically fit and healthy", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm going to join a fitness club.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le01ob01aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "zumba", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a physical activity involving dance movements, usually performed to Latin American music", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm going to try a new zumba class.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le01ob01aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "kickboxing", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a self-defense discipline that combines kicking and punching", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They offer kickboxing lessons as well.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le01ob01aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "free trial period", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a period of time during which you can try a service for free", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The fitness club has a free trial period.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le01ob01aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to surf the web", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to go on the Internet", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Dancing beats staying at home and surfing the web for hours.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le01ob01aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to rely on", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to place trust in something or someone; to depend on", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I rely on social media to advertise my restaurant.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le01ob01aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "online buzz", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the attention that something or someone gets online", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I rely on social media to get online buzz about the restaurant.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le01ob01aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn7le01ob01re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Ask 8 people you know about their plans for the future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask them if they like to make New Year's resolutions and if they usually stick to them.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write the resolutions in the chart below.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your answers with your partner. </br> </br></br> </br></br> </br></br> ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":10,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Person\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Resolutions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do they stick to them?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I talk about future actions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask for clarification about plans in the future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about social activities. </br>", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"id": 0, "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}]}, {"title": "", "id": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn7le01ob01re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn7le01ob01re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I can't believe the Christmas holidays are over! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        I know what you mean. This time of year always makes me want to start new things. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I don't like to make New Year's resolutions. I can never stick to them for more than a couple of weeks.", "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn7le01ob01re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Come on! What about taking up a new sport? I'm going to join a fitness club. You should come, too.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    Do you know which one you'll go to? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: There's a new gym right by my office. They offer Pilates, zumba and kickboxing classes. They have a free trial period. I think I'll try everything.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Don't you think that sounds a bit too intense?", "time": "14200"}, {"image": "engenn7le01ob01re2img01.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        It beats staying at home and surfing the web all night! You should spend less time on the computer.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    It's hard to keep in touch with people without it. I rely on social media to get online buzz about the restaurant. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:        Can you remember the last time you spent a day without looking at a screen? Physical activities will do you good. Trust me.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    Alright, I'll make an effort.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         The new year is going to be awesome!", "time": "36100"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le01ob01re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn7le01ob01re2aud01"}}]}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about social activities.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can ask for clarification.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about future action.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Do you like to make plans for the future?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What kind of activities do you like to plan ahead?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Are you good at keeping to your plans?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " New year, new ideas! Let's make plans for the future!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"questions": [{"responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}]}], "id": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " \nSally and Vanessa are making plans for the new year. Will they be able <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">to stick to</span> their resolutions?\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}]}, {"content": [{"tip_id": 0, "content": "<span class=\"italic\"> \u201cTo stick to\u201d</span> is a phrasal verb. You change the meaning of verbs by using different prepositions, like <span class=\"italic\">to</span> or <span class=\"italic\">with</span>.", "type": "text"}], "type": "tips"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: Click on the play button to listen to the audio.\n", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "STI", "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1]}, {"questions": [{"responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "She wants to spend more time surfing the web.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": false}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "She wants to try zumba.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": "", "correct": true}, {"id": 2, "_data": [{"content": "She doesn't want to try kickboxing.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": "", "correct": 0}, {"id": 3, "_data": [{"content": "She wants to learn how to surf.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": "", "correct": 0}, {"id": 4, "_data": [{"content": "She wants to use the free trial period to join a fitness club.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": "", "correct": true}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "Which are Sally's New Year's resolutions?", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}]}, {"responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "She doesn't like to make New Year's resolutions.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "She is very good at sticking to new activities.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": "", "correct": 0}, {"id": 2, "_data": [{"content": "She thinks that trying every fitness class sounds too intense.", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": "", "correct": true}, {"id": 3, "_data": [{"content": "She needs to stay connected .", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "text": "", "correct": false}, {"id": 4, "_data": [{"content": "She doesn't need the computer to keep in touch with people.", "type": "text"}], "s